  "description": { "ko_kr": "보라타운 포켓몬타워 상층을 점거한 로켓단을 몰아냅니다.", "en_us": "Drive Team Rocket from the upper floors of Pokemon Tower." },
  "preset": "cobbleventure:team_rocket_facility",
